erce, and Management.\\n\\nIDE follows the curriculum of the University of Madras, ensuring that distance learners receive the same quality of education as regular students. The institute utilizes a combination of study materials, personal contact programs (PCP), and an online portal to facilitate effective learning. With its legacy and reputation, it remains a preferred choice for working professionals and students seeking flexible academic pathways.","highlights":["UGC-DEB Recognized Programs","Legacy of Madras University Excellence","Flexible Learning Modules","Affordable Fee Structure","Extensive Study Material Support","Online Admission & Examination Portal","Large Network of Study Centers","Personal Contact Programs (PCP)","Widely Accepted Degrees for Government Jobs","Diverse Course Portfolio","Rich Academic Heritage"],"departments":[{"name":"B.A. History","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Mathematics","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Com. General","level":"UG"},{"name":"M.A. English","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.Sc. Computer Science","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.B.A.","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.Sc. Information Technology","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.Com.","level":"PG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-book","name":"Digital Library Access"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Study Centers"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Online Learning Portal"},{"icon":"ti-printer","name":"Print Study Materials"},{"icon":"ti-headphone-alt","name":"Student Helpline"},{"icon":"ti-write","name":"Examination Support"},{"icon":"ti-id-badge","name":"Identity Card Services"},{"icon":"ti-server","name":"E-Content Resources"},{"icon":"ti-clipboard","name":"Assignment Submission"},{"icon":"ti-panel","name":"PCP Centers"}],"placementRate":60,"avgPackage":"₹2.2 LPA","highestPackage":"₹4.0 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Online Registration","desc":"Visit the official IDE UNOM portal and register for the desired program."},{"title":"Document Upload","desc":"Upload required academic transcripts, identity pr